    "sections": {
        "description": "The Gymnastics Center Theme is a modern, responsive, and professional solution built for gymnastics academies, fitness studios, acrobatics schools, kids’ training programs, athletic clubs, martial arts centers, yoga classes, pilates studios, dance schools, personal trainers, sports coaching centers, and fitness academies, making it ideal for creating a strong online presence. Its clean layout and dynamic design capture the energy, flexibility, and discipline of gymnastics, acrobatics, and sports performance while delivering smooth navigation across all devices. Lightweight and SEO-friendly, it offers customizable sections to showcase class schedules, trainer or instructor profiles, membership plans, training programs, pricing tables, portfolios, and testimonials, ensuring your offerings stand out. Integrated call-to-action buttons drive sign-ups, bookings, and inquiries, while compatibility with essential plugins like WooCommerce for merchandise and memberships, Contact Form 7 for seamless communication, and The Events Calendar for scheduling classes and workshops enhances functionality. Fully translation-ready and equipped with a user-friendly admin panel, this theme allows effortless customization without coding knowledge. With its blend of style, versatility, and high performance, the Gymnastics Center Theme is the perfect choice to grow your sports training business, manage memberships, and promote gymnastics or fitness programs online. Demo:https://live.theclassictemplates.com/gymnastics-center-pro/"
    },
